{"seq":2,"slug":"hash-mac","title":"哈希与消息认证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/foundations/hash-mac","wordCount":1833,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"哈希与消息认证\">哈希与消息认证</h1><p>把任意长度的数据压成一段固定长度的「指纹」，且无法从指纹反推原文、也几乎不可能找到两份不同数据撞出同一指纹——密码学哈希函数提供的就是这种看似简单却支撑起整个安全世界的能力。Git 用它给每次提交命名，区块链用它串起账本，密码系统用它把口令变成不可逆的存储形态，数字签名先哈希再签名。哈希本身不含密钥，但只要给它配上密钥，就升级成消息认证码（MAC），能回答「这条消息确实出自持有密钥的人、且一字未改」。这一章讲清楚哈希、MAC 与口令哈希这三类既相关又绝不可混用的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个密码学哈希函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 必须同时满足三条性质，缺一不可：抗原像性（给定哈希值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，找不到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(m)=h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>）、抗第二原像性（给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，找不到不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(m_2)=H(m_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）、抗碰撞性（找不到任意一对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_1 \\neq m_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(m_1)=H(m_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）。抗碰撞最难达到，因为按生日悖论，对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 位输出的哈希，随机尝试约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{n/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次就有较大概率撞上——这就是为什么 SHA-256 的 128 位碰撞强度才被认为安全，而早已被攻破的 MD5（128 位输出，碰撞强度仅 64 位）和 SHA-1（已被实际构造出碰撞）必须淘汰。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[任意长度输入] --&gt; B{用途?}&#10;  B --&gt;|完整性指纹| C[SHA-256 / SHA-3]&#10;  B --&gt;|带密钥的消息认证| D[HMAC-SHA256&lt;br/&gt;或 KMAC]&#10;  B --&gt;|口令存储| E[Argon2id / bcrypt]&#10;  B --&gt;|密钥派生| F[HKDF / PBKDF2]&#10;  C --&gt; G[固定长度摘要]&#10;  D --&gt; H[认证标签 tag]&#10;  E --&gt; I[慢哈希 + salt]&#10;  F --&gt; J[派生出的密钥材料]\">flowchart TD\n  A[任意长度输入] --&gt; B{用途?}\n  B --&gt;|完整性指纹| C[SHA-256 / SHA-3]\n  B --&gt;|带密钥的消息认证| D[HMAC-SHA256&lt;br/&gt;或 KMAC]\n  B --&gt;|口令存储| E[Argon2id / bcrypt]\n  B --&gt;|密钥派生| F[HKDF / PBKDF2]\n  C --&gt; G[固定长度摘要]\n  D --&gt; H[认证标签 tag]\n  E --&gt; I[慢哈希 + salt]\n  F --&gt; J[派生出的密钥材料]</pre><p>下表区分三类极易被混淆的「哈希」工具——它们用途不同，绝不能互相替代：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>是否带密钥</th>\n<th>设计目标</th>\n<th>速度要求</th>\n<th>典型算法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通用哈希</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>完整性指纹、去重、内容寻址</td>\n<td>越快越好</td>\n<td>SHA-256、SHA-3、BLAKE3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAC</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>认证消息来源与完整性</td>\n<td>越快越好</td>\n<td>HMAC-SHA256、KMAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>口令哈希</td>\n<td>否（用 salt）</td>\n<td>抵抗暴力破解口令</td>\n<td>越慢越好</td>\n<td>Argon2id、bcrypt、scrypt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KDF</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td>从密钥/口令派生密钥</td>\n<td>视场景</td>\n<td>HKDF、PBKDF2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最常见的致命错误就是拿通用哈希去存口令：SHA-256 太快了，GPU 每秒能算上百亿次，用户的弱口令瞬间被字典撞穿。口令哈希必须刻意地慢、刻意地耗内存——这是它与通用哈希在设计哲学上的根本对立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sha-2-sha-3-与现代哈希家族\">SHA-2、SHA-3 与现代哈希家族</h2><p>SHA-256 和 SHA-512 属于 SHA-2 家族，采用 Merkle–Damgård 结构：把消息分块后逐块压缩，每块的输出作为下一块的输入。这个结构有个副作用——长度扩展攻击：知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(secret \\| msg)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">secr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">msg</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 长度的攻击者，无需知道 secret 就能算出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(secret \\| msg \\| pad \\| extra)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">secr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这正是「绝不要用裸哈希拼接密钥来做认证」的原因，也是 HMAC 必须存在的动机之一。</p>\n<p>SHA-3（Keccak）采用截然不同的海绵（sponge）结构，先把数据「吸收」进一个大状态，再「挤出」摘要，天然免疫长度扩展攻击。它不是因为 SHA-2 被攻破才标准化的，而是作为算法多样性的战略备份。工程上还有 BLAKE3 这类追求极致速度的现代哈希，利用树形结构和 SIMD 并行，吞吐远超 SHA-256，适合大文件校验与内容寻址。NIST 关于哈希在口令场景的明确立场是：MD5、SHA-1、乃至单独的 SHA-256 都绝不能用于存储口令（<a href=\"https://guptadeepak.com/research/password-hashing-guide-2026/\">密码哈希指南 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hmac-用哈希构造可证明安全的-mac\">HMAC：用哈希构造可证明安全的 MAC</h2><p>HMAC 的巧妙之处在于它把一个不带密钥的哈希函数安全地「升级」成带密钥的 MAC，并能在哈希压缩函数满足一定假设时给出安全性证明。其构造是两层嵌套哈希：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HMAC</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>⊕</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HMAC}(K, m) = H\\big((K \\oplus opad) \\,\\|\\, H((K \\oplus ipad) \\,\\|\\, m)\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HMAC</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">opad</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ipad</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是两个固定的填充常量。这种双层结构正好抵消了 Merkle–Damgård 的长度扩展弱点，所以即便底层是有此弱点的 SHA-256，HMAC-SHA256 依然安全。</p>\n<p>验证 MAC 时有一个极易被忽视却致命的细节：比较收到的标签与本地计算的标签时，绝不能用普通的字节比较（遇到第一个不同字节就提前返回）。那种比较的耗时会泄露「前几个字节是否猜对」，攻击者可借时序逐字节爆破出合法标签。正确做法是恒定时间比较——无论哪里不同都比完全程。这类时序侧信道在 <a href=\"../frontier/crypto-engineering-misuse\">密码工程与误用</a> 中有专门的深入讨论。MAC 与对称加密结合形成的 AEAD（其 tag 本质就是一种内嵌的 MAC）则在 <a href=\"symmetric-encryption\">对称加密</a> 里讲解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"口令哈希与密钥派生-刻意的慢\">口令哈希与密钥派生：刻意的慢</h2><p>存储用户口令是哈希应用中规则最特殊的一块。除了必须用慢哈希，还必须为每个口令加独立的随机 salt（盐），防止攻击者用预计算的彩虹表一次性破解所有用户。2026 年的明确共识是：新系统一律用 Argon2id，它同时消耗时间与内存，使 GPU/ASIC 的并行优势大打折扣。OWASP 与 NIST SP 800-63B 给出的推荐参数为时间代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>、内存代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>MiB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=64\\,\\text{MiB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MiB</span></span></span></span></span></span>、并行度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://guptadeepak.com/bcrypt-vs-argon2-vs-scrypt-vs-pbkdf2-password-hashing-decision-framework-2026/\">密码哈希决策框架 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>几个关键边界要记清：bcrypt 在遗留系统里仍可接受（代价因子 ≥ 10），但新项目应选 Argon2id；Argon2 截至 2026 年中尚未进入 FIPS 批准列表，因此在需要 FIPS-140 合规的场景，唯一可用的是 PBKDF2-SHA256，迭代次数至少 60 万次。</p>\n<p>口令哈希解决的是「人类记得住的弱口令如何安全存储」，而 KDF（如 HKDF）解决的是另一个问题——从一段高熵的密钥材料中派生出多把用途隔离的子密钥，常见于协议握手后从共享密钥扩展出收发双向密钥。HKDF 的输入是高熵密钥，因此可以快；PBKDF2 的输入是低熵口令，因此必须慢。这条「按输入熵决定快慢」的判断线，和 <a href=\"randomness-entropy\">随机数与熵</a> 讲的熵概念一脉相承。哈希作为数字签名的第一步（先哈希再签）则在 <a href=\"../public-key/key-exchange-signatures\">密钥交换与数字签名</a> 里展开。</p>\n<p>三大哈希家族的结构与特性可对照如下，这解释了「什么时候必须换成 HMAC/SHA-3」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>家族</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>长度扩展攻击</th>\n<th>主要特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SHA-2</td>\n<td>Merkle–Damgård</td>\n<td>易受</td>\n<td>部署最广，配合 HMAC 方可安全认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHA-3</td>\n<td>海绵（sponge）</td>\n<td>免疫</td>\n<td>算法多样性战略备份</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BLAKE3</td>\n<td>树形 + SIMD</td>\n<td>免疫</td>\n<td>吞吐远超 SHA-256，适合大文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>密码学哈希需同时满足抗原像、抗第二原像、抗碰撞三性质；按生日界，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 位输出的碰撞强度只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 位，故 MD5/SHA-1 已淘汰。</li>\n<li>通用哈希、MAC、口令哈希、KDF 是四类用途互斥的工具，最常见的事故是拿快哈希存口令。</li>\n<li>SHA-2 有长度扩展弱点，认证场景必须用 HMAC；SHA-3 的海绵结构天然免疫该弱点。</li>\n<li>HMAC 通过双层嵌套把无密钥哈希升级为有安全证明的 MAC；验证 tag 必须用恒定时间比较。</li>\n<li>存口令一律 Argon2id（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn><mtext>MiB</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=3,\\ m=64\\text{MiB},\\ p=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MiB</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）加独立 salt；FIPS 合规退而用 PBKDF2-SHA256（≥60 万次迭代）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"哈希与消息认证","id":"哈希与消息认证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SHA-2、SHA-3 与现代哈希家族","id":"sha-2-sha-3-与现代哈希家族"},{"level":2,"text":"HMAC：用哈希构造可证明安全的 MAC","id":"hmac-用哈希构造可证明安全的-mac"},{"level":2,"text":"口令哈希与密钥派生：刻意的慢","id":"口令哈希与密钥派生-刻意的慢"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"对称加密","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/foundations/symmetric-encryption"},"next":{"title":"随机数与熵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/applied-cryptography/foundations/randomness-entropy"}}